{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53560","headline":"题王右军遗迹 · 元稹","name":"题王右军遗迹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"生卧竹堂虚室白，逍遥松迳远山青。\n（同前）（按：《封书》、《春词》及《送晏秀才归江陵》以降各句，冀勤校点本《元稹集》均已据花房英树《元稹研究》收录。\n今据王水照教授自日本携归之东京大学图书馆藏森鸥外捐赠抄本《千载佳句》复印本校录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53560.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53560","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}